                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "R02",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Text from the accounting server and saved notes reaches the model, but there is no test showing an attack in that text is stopped.\n\nLead: Security. Show proof it works before release.\n\nHow to fix:\n1. Write ten fake tool results that tell the agent to send a refund or an email.\n2. Feed each one to the agent in a test setup, not in production.\n3. Repeat each one five times and count how often the agent obeys.\n4. Save the results with the date and the code version.\n\nDone when: A dated test record shows how often attacks in tool text work, and none of them moved money or sent email."
          },
